WEBVTT

00:00.690 --> 00:03.480
There are steps that must be taken 
to become a head priest.

00:03.480 --> 00:07.370
Before entering the training ground, 
you must first undergo "tokudo."

00:07.370 --> 00:10.990
It involves studying sutras 
and rituals under a master

00:11.290 --> 00:12.990
and earning the right to become a priest.

00:13.910 --> 00:17.340
Put simply, it's becoming a priest.

00:17.910 --> 00:20.660
Yuzuki hasn't undergone tokudo yet, either.

00:20.660 --> 00:21.370
Huh?

00:21.370 --> 00:25.140
Like you, she hasn't even become a priest yet.

00:25.640 --> 00:29.710
Normally, my students train for 
a year before undergoing tokudo,

00:29.710 --> 00:32.510
but she's attempting to do that in six months,

00:32.510 --> 00:35.220
while attending school, no less,

00:35.220 --> 00:38.720
so she can become a head priest 
as quickly as possible.

00:39.220 --> 00:42.980
You will undergo tokudo within three months.

00:42.980 --> 00:48.600
If you can't, then I'd like to 
call off our engagement.

00:49.530 --> 00:52.230
There's a problem with your 
tokudo ceremony, Yuzuki.

00:52.920 --> 00:56.480
The ceremony is held at the temple 
the candidate trains at.

00:56.480 --> 00:59.200
In other words, it'd be in the 
main hall of this temple.

00:59.200 --> 01:00.370
Okay...

01:00.980 --> 01:04.350
Several important members of the 
sect attend the ceremony, as well.

01:04.350 --> 01:08.880
And the temple where the ceremony 
is held is subject to an inspection.

01:10.880 --> 01:12.840
Duct Tape

01:15.250 --> 01:17.720
We can't afford to repair...

01:17.720 --> 01:19.390
...the temple's principal figure!

01:23.600 --> 01:25.030
As you can see,

01:25.620 --> 01:28.040
in order for the tokudo ceremony 
to be held at this temple,

01:28.040 --> 01:30.110
the principal figure must be repaired.

01:30.110 --> 01:33.780
At the very least, we must do
something about its broken neck.

01:33.780 --> 01:36.900
I asked around for some quotes,

01:37.680 --> 01:42.020
and at minimum, the repairs will cost 500,000.

01:44.560 --> 01:46.750
That's a lot of money.

01:46.750 --> 01:49.380
It's my fault. I'm sorry.

01:50.210 --> 01:51.590
Don't worry.

01:53.090 --> 01:55.050
I'll figure something out.

01:58.050 --> 02:01.100
Yuzuki-san, how can you be so sure?

02:01.100 --> 02:03.930
I have a feeling it'll be fine, so it'll be fine.

02:03.930 --> 02:06.280
Has your meat-headedness 
 progressed that far?!

02:06.280 --> 02:08.330
Were you listening to anything I said, Yuzuki?!

02:08.330 --> 02:09.720
We're talking about 500,000 yen!

02:09.720 --> 02:12.310
That's not an easy amount to raise!

02:12.620 --> 02:15.120
We're always broke and short-staffed.

02:15.120 --> 02:17.930
We haven't even been able to properly 
repair our principle figure.

02:20.000 --> 02:22.350
Hoan-san knew that.

02:22.350 --> 02:26.730
He knew that and insisted I undergo 
tokudo within three months.

02:27.530 --> 02:33.000
If I can't manage this, then it's impossible 
for me to overcome my reality.

02:33.310 --> 02:36.010
Leave it to me, Kiki-san and Akagami-kun.

02:36.560 --> 02:38.760
After all...

02:39.440 --> 02:42.790
I'm going to take over Mikazuki Temple!

04:14.560 --> 04:19.110
<b>Episode 11:
The Body Doesn't Lie</b>

04:15.830 --> 04:21.260
<i>I can't allow Yuzuki-san to take 
on the entire burden alone.</i>

04:22.990 --> 04:25.990
Looking For Part-time Employees

04:22.990 --> 04:25.990
No experience necessary!!

04:22.990 --> 04:25.990
45458181
listings nationwide

04:22.990 --> 04:25.990
<b>A website
for finding
part-time work</b>

04:22.990 --> 04:25.990
<b>Register your contact information (free) here!!</b>

04:28.910 --> 04:31.370
<i>My contact information, huh?</i>

04:31.690 --> 04:36.710
<i>I can't let the others find out, 
so I can't use this temple's number.</i>

04:37.380 --> 04:40.380
<i>But I don't have a phone.</i>

04:43.020 --> 04:45.880
<i>I suppose I can borrow one for now.</i>

04:47.730 --> 04:50.260
Yuzuki-san, do you have a moment?

04:50.260 --> 04:52.200
Huh? Akagami-kun?

04:53.620 --> 04:55.130
Give me a second.

04:55.130 --> 04:56.230
What?

05:01.760 --> 05:03.130
Thanks for waiting.

05:09.810 --> 05:12.290
What do you need at this hour?

05:12.740 --> 05:14.710
Let's not talk in the hallway.

05:15.620 --> 05:17.290
Would you like to come in?

05:18.530 --> 05:19.290
So...

05:21.330 --> 05:22.730
Do you need something?

05:23.840 --> 05:24.880
<i>What?</i>

05:25.370 --> 05:29.260
<i>Am I not supposed to say anything?</i>

05:29.640 --> 05:32.960
<i>She's wearing a maid uniform, isn't she?</i>

05:32.960 --> 05:35.640
<i>Why is she acting like she always does?</i>

05:36.010 --> 05:37.960
What's the matter, Akagami-kun?

05:37.960 --> 05:39.150
Nothing!

05:42.420 --> 05:46.900
<i>Calm down. I only came to borrow a phone.</i>

05:47.230 --> 05:50.410
I have a request.

05:51.360 --> 05:52.660
A request?

05:52.660 --> 05:54.840
A request, is it?

05:54.840 --> 05:59.200
Don't be shy, Master. 
You can ask me whatever you'd like.

05:59.200 --> 06:00.880
Ph-Phone...

06:00.880 --> 06:03.840
How shall I serve you?

06:03.840 --> 06:05.670
A ph-phone...

06:06.560 --> 06:08.600
Please lend me a phone.

06:08.600 --> 06:09.920
Sure!

06:10.430 --> 06:13.160
<i>My brain won't stop showing me 
images of maid role-play!</i>

06:13.160 --> 06:15.660
<i>I'm never going to last like this!</i>

06:15.660 --> 06:17.940
A phone, right? Hold on.

06:17.940 --> 06:21.210
Huh? Where is it?

06:25.320 --> 06:28.700
Oh, so it did fall down here.

06:28.700 --> 06:31.280
Almost there.

06:31.280 --> 06:33.330
I found it, Akagami-kun.

06:34.020 --> 06:35.950
You're bleeding like crazy!

06:35.950 --> 06:38.680
Are you okay? You're acting weird!

06:38.680 --> 06:40.710
<i>Should </i>you<i> be saying that?!</i>

06:41.960 --> 06:45.250
So, what do you need it for?

06:45.760 --> 06:48.060
I was hoping to borrow your phone number.

06:48.530 --> 06:51.760
I need contact information to work.

06:53.120 --> 06:56.230
<i>Mission accomplished.</i>

06:58.670 --> 07:00.180
Yuzuki-san?

07:00.180 --> 07:01.580
Yeah.

07:04.610 --> 07:08.090
Akagami-kun, what kind of 
clothes are you wearing?

07:08.740 --> 07:10.760
<i>Is this some kind of joke?</i>

07:10.760 --> 07:12.780
<i>Is she hoping I'll comment on her maid uniform?</i>

07:13.160 --> 07:16.280
<i>I don't know, but I'll give 
her the straight answer.</i>

07:16.880 --> 07:18.540
Monk's work clothes.

07:26.400 --> 07:28.820
Yes, that's right.

07:30.330 --> 07:32.920
And you're wearing them 
because you're in training.

07:32.920 --> 07:38.060
Right now, you should be focusing on your 
training instead of thinking about working.

07:38.060 --> 07:41.810
But I need to contribute as much as possible 
to the principle figure's repairs!

07:42.330 --> 07:44.520
I'll work. Don't you worry about it.

07:44.520 --> 07:46.820
Aren't you in training, too?!

07:46.820 --> 07:48.730
Besides, it'll take a long time

07:48.730 --> 07:52.040
for a high school student working 
part time to earn 500,000.

07:52.040 --> 07:53.180
It'll be okay.

07:54.240 --> 07:56.280
I'm planning to work five or six jobs.

07:56.280 --> 07:57.960
That doesn't sound okay at all!

07:57.960 --> 07:59.640
Your meat-headedness has gone too far!

07:59.640 --> 08:01.330
No, it'll work out.

08:01.330 --> 08:03.560
At least allow us to help—

08:03.560 --> 08:04.580
Akagami-kun.

08:05.580 --> 08:08.360
I started this.

08:08.360 --> 08:12.090
Imposing on everyone else would be wrong.

08:12.810 --> 08:13.960
Yuzuki-san...

08:14.340 --> 08:18.300
Besides, my mom did it alone.

08:18.300 --> 08:18.950
What?

08:19.960 --> 08:24.900
<i>Yuzuki-san's mother is that woman 
Tsukina-san, who Tendou-san mentioned.</i>

08:24.900 --> 08:27.750
It's okay, Akagami-kun.

08:29.990 --> 08:32.400
I'll figure something out.

08:32.400 --> 08:34.400
Wh-What will you do, exactly?

08:34.400 --> 08:38.490
Well... I'll double my shifts.

08:38.490 --> 08:40.700
That's just not possible, Yuzuki-san!

08:40.700 --> 08:42.480
Are you dumb?!

08:42.480 --> 08:43.370
What?!

08:43.370 --> 08:47.880
I have plenty of work experience. 
Let me handle this.

08:47.880 --> 08:51.690
You don't sound very convincing when you 
won't even look at me, Akagami-kun!

08:51.690 --> 08:54.380
Crap! I couldn't stand looking directly at her!

08:54.380 --> 08:57.150
I'm so stupid, you can't bear to look at me?

08:57.150 --> 08:59.010
No, that's not what I meant.

08:59.010 --> 09:03.290
Then are you refusing to 
look at me because I'm right?

09:03.290 --> 09:04.190
Wha—

09:04.190 --> 09:05.770
Then let me handle this.

09:05.770 --> 09:09.400
I can't help it! Just look at how you're dressed!

09:10.800 --> 09:11.660
Huh?

09:14.840 --> 09:17.500
No way! I've been wearing this the whole time?

09:17.500 --> 09:21.790
You're wearing the cutest,
sexiest outfit I can imagine!

09:21.790 --> 09:24.880
You look exceptionally beautiful when 
our eyes meet, and your charms are—

09:24.880 --> 09:27.920
You idiot, Akagami-kun!
This is too embarrassing!

09:27.920 --> 09:29.420
There's a reason for this.

09:29.420 --> 09:32.720
The desire to be served by you 
was too much for me!

09:32.720 --> 09:34.300
Please, listen to me!

09:35.410 --> 09:40.310
In other words, that maid uniform 
is your friend's work uniform.

09:41.300 --> 09:45.850
She suggested you work together, 
so you borrowed hers so you could try it on.

09:47.290 --> 09:51.350
And I showed up after 
you fell asleep wearing it.

09:52.840 --> 09:57.880
I was half-asleep. 
I'm exhausted from looking for work.

09:58.990 --> 10:02.720
See? You're already tired!

10:02.720 --> 10:05.000
I-I'm not tired!

10:05.000 --> 10:07.520
You're still determined to resist me?

10:07.520 --> 10:08.810
I'm not tired!

10:08.810 --> 10:11.250
That outfit is proof of your exhaustion.

10:14.250 --> 10:15.790
Then let's make a bet!

10:15.790 --> 10:16.760
Huh?

10:16.760 --> 10:20.510
Test me to see if I'm actually tired.

10:20.510 --> 10:24.480
If you can make me fall asleep, then you win.

10:24.480 --> 10:27.640
M-Make you fall asleep? But how?

10:28.030 --> 10:30.560
Maybe with a massage or something!

10:30.560 --> 10:32.400
You want me to serve a maid?

10:32.520 --> 10:33.630
Go right ahead.

10:33.630 --> 10:34.780
Seriously?

10:34.780 --> 10:36.760
No, I can't do this.

10:36.760 --> 10:40.410
Just looking at her does that to me. 
Touching her directly is impossible.

10:40.730 --> 10:42.840
What's the matter, Akagami-kun?

10:43.590 --> 10:45.040
N-Nothing.

10:46.440 --> 10:48.350
Do you admit defeat?

10:48.350 --> 10:50.780
Then I can't lend you my phone.

10:51.880 --> 10:53.790
In that case, excuse me.

10:56.550 --> 10:58.910
Looks like you've found your motivation.

10:58.910 --> 11:01.610
But my training has toughened me—

11:03.880 --> 11:06.520
What... is this?

11:06.520 --> 11:09.780
This isn't fair. Why are you so good at this?

11:10.280 --> 11:13.210
<i>This feeling, this reaction...</i>

11:14.200 --> 11:15.560
Right there.

11:16.400 --> 11:19.150
<i>She really is exhausted.</i>

11:19.150 --> 11:22.320
<i>The body doesn't lie, Yuzuki-san.</i>

11:22.700 --> 11:25.040
<i>I'll begin by promoting the 
flow of lymphatic fluid</i>

11:25.040 --> 11:27.860
<i>from the back of her neck 
to her shoulder blades.</i>

11:29.830 --> 11:35.660
<i>Next, I'll stretch her lower body and improve 
circulation throughout her entire body.</i>

11:36.670 --> 11:39.450
Her side-boobs are wide open.

11:39.450 --> 11:41.530
It'd just be a little accident.

11:41.530 --> 11:44.300
Don't forget her rear and thighs.

11:44.300 --> 11:47.180
You have to loosen up her entire body evenly.

11:48.040 --> 11:54.600
Do it! Do it! Do it!

11:51.960 --> 11:54.600
Akagami-kun...

11:58.610 --> 12:02.200
<i>I must hurry! My sense of reason won't last!</i>

12:07.880 --> 12:09.620
Akagami-kun!

12:09.620 --> 12:11.020
Wait! Oh!

12:14.050 --> 12:15.400
No!

12:16.240 --> 12:19.370
Yeah, no way.

12:19.960 --> 12:22.760
Akagami, you finally—

12:24.440 --> 12:26.880
It's so good!

12:26.880 --> 12:28.760
You're wrestling now?!

12:29.200 --> 12:30.380
<i>I endured it.</i>

12:30.380 --> 12:33.160
Yuzu-nee, why are you wearing a maid uniform?

12:33.750 --> 12:36.860
Tsukuyo-san, there's a reason for this.

12:36.860 --> 12:40.250
I won our...

12:43.460 --> 12:45.750
See? I'm not tired at...

12:46.400 --> 12:48.580
Yuzuki-san, give it up already.

12:48.580 --> 12:51.400
I can do it myself.

12:51.680 --> 12:54.080
Why are you being so stubborn?

12:54.080 --> 12:55.580
B-Because...

12:55.580 --> 12:56.790
Forget it!

12:57.570 --> 12:59.670
It's none of your business!

13:05.520 --> 13:06.620
I see.

13:08.600 --> 13:09.320
Akagami-kun—

13:09.320 --> 13:13.070
Since it's none of my business, 
I'll do what I want!

13:13.070 --> 13:14.080
Tsukuyo-san!

13:14.080 --> 13:14.730
Yes?

13:14.730 --> 13:17.440
Will you go out with me?

13:17.440 --> 13:18.360
What?

13:18.360 --> 13:20.650
Let's go out together tomorrow.

13:20.650 --> 13:21.360
Huh?

13:21.760 --> 13:23.450
Go out—what?

13:25.120 --> 13:27.990
What?!

13:28.280 --> 13:31.990
<b>A trick up the sleeve.</b>

13:35.000 --> 13:40.110
Tsukuyo-san, will you go out with me?

13:40.110 --> 13:41.000
What?

13:42.150 --> 13:44.190
Will you marry me, too?

13:44.190 --> 13:45.130
Huh?

13:45.130 --> 13:47.740
We'll consummate our marriage immediately.

13:47.740 --> 13:48.890
Consummate?

13:48.890 --> 13:51.880
And have children. So many, many children.

13:51.880 --> 13:52.640
Hey, wait!

13:52.640 --> 13:54.600
No!

13:59.230 --> 14:00.990
What would you like?

14:00.990 --> 14:03.050
Three trips to a sweets buffet.

14:03.680 --> 14:05.440
Would you settle for two?

14:05.440 --> 14:06.610
No.

14:07.320 --> 14:08.380
Okay.

14:14.280 --> 14:18.120
<i>Was what he said yesterday 
a confession of his feelings?</i>

14:18.120 --> 14:21.000
Will you go out with me?

14:21.000 --> 14:21.920
What?

14:21.920 --> 14:25.400
<i>He even invited me on a date.</i>

14:25.400 --> 14:28.410
<i>When did Akagami develop feelings for me?</i>

14:29.430 --> 14:33.110
<i>Wait, am I misunderstanding 
the situation again?</i>

14:33.680 --> 14:36.180
<i>Ugh, that seems possible.</i>

14:36.510 --> 14:38.120
<i>I totally am.</i>

14:40.200 --> 14:42.620
<i>Well, I won't be fooled again.</i>

14:42.620 --> 14:46.740
<i>Okay, I won't think too hard 
about today. I'll take it easy.</i>

14:46.740 --> 14:51.490
Mikazuki Temple

14:51.490 --> 14:54.740
<b>Her Favorite Knit Sweater</b>

14:54.740 --> 14:57.750
<b>Her Favorite Skirt</b>

14:57.750 --> 15:00.750
<b>Brand-new Shoes</b>

15:00.750 --> 15:04.250
<b>Max-effort "Natural" Makeup</b>

15:05.570 --> 15:09.260
<i>I totally didn't put any effort 
into my appearance.</i>

15:09.540 --> 15:12.760
<i>I'm just excited to go out on my day off.</i>

15:13.080 --> 15:16.360
<i>I wouldn't want him to think I phoned it in.</i>

15:16.360 --> 15:17.850
Thank you for waiting.

15:19.390 --> 15:24.230
Sorry, Tsukuyo-san. 
My morning training made me late.

15:24.020 --> 15:25.150
Same As Always

15:27.030 --> 15:29.530
<i>See? I knew it.</i>

15:29.820 --> 15:33.910
<i>He's wearing his work clothes. 
This doesn't feel like a date at all.</i>

15:36.720 --> 15:40.320
<i>I definitely misunderstood his intentions.</i>

15:40.320 --> 15:41.220
Huh?

15:42.010 --> 15:45.590
Tsukuyo-san, you look 
exceptionally pretty today.

15:46.640 --> 15:51.050
I feel nervous going out 
with such a beautiful lady.

15:54.600 --> 15:57.150
I never said I'd go out with you!

15:57.150 --> 15:59.810
What? You won't go out with me?

15:59.810 --> 16:02.810
<i>No, wait. Calm down.</i>

16:02.810 --> 16:06.200
I'm not confused, okay? Let's go.

16:06.200 --> 16:08.570
What? So you will come with me?

16:09.600 --> 16:11.570
So, where are we going?

16:11.920 --> 16:13.600
To the phone shop.

16:13.600 --> 16:16.830
I was hoping you'd show me the way.

16:16.830 --> 16:19.830
Oh, right. You lost your phone, right?

16:20.220 --> 16:21.400
Anything else?

16:21.400 --> 16:22.630
That's all I had planned.

16:23.130 --> 16:25.260
Is there anything you need to do?

16:25.710 --> 16:31.340
Not really. I just happened to be free today.

16:31.340 --> 16:33.000
<i>That's all, huh?</i>

16:33.000 --> 16:36.590
<i>Yeah, yeah. I'm just here to be his guide.</i>

16:36.960 --> 16:38.940
Have you already decided which phone you want?

16:38.940 --> 16:43.070
Yes. I'd like to spend as 
little money as possible.

16:43.070 --> 16:44.100
I see.

16:44.100 --> 16:49.980
Couple's First Plan
980 yen/month

16:44.100 --> 16:49.980
For cohabitating couples!

16:44.100 --> 16:49.980
For couples with the same
name or address

16:44.560 --> 16:47.020
I was thinking about buying this plan.

16:50.330 --> 16:53.240
For... cohabitating...

16:53.240 --> 16:56.490
Yes. After all, we live together.

16:56.490 --> 16:58.740
We're just roommates!

17:01.460 --> 17:05.150
You can't sign up for that plan with a minor.

17:05.150 --> 17:06.650
I see.

17:06.650 --> 17:08.350
Well, yeah.

17:08.350 --> 17:11.760
What about this plan instead?

17:11.760 --> 17:22.770
<b>1080 yen/month</b>

17:11.760 --> 17:22.770
<b>Super cheap!</b>

17:11.760 --> 17:22.770
<b>Good value phone plan!</b>

17:12.160 --> 17:15.660
You'll have tons of time 
to talk with your loved ones.

17:15.660 --> 17:19.180
Looks like the base cost is pretty low.

17:19.180 --> 17:20.720
I'll go with this, then.

17:20.720 --> 17:22.770
I'd like to buy the phone using points, please.

17:22.770 --> 17:24.380
Certainly.

17:28.120 --> 17:30.310
One moment, please.

17:33.540 --> 17:36.530
<i>Aw, man. This sucks.</i>

17:36.530 --> 17:39.630
<i>That clerk totally got the wrong idea about us.</i>

17:39.630 --> 17:42.540
<i>Is this his roundabout way of harassing me?</i>

17:44.690 --> 17:47.310
<i>I've had enough. I'm going home.</i>

17:47.310 --> 17:48.330
Here you go.

17:48.330 --> 17:49.240
Huh?

17:48.330 --> 17:51.840
<b>Tanu-Tanu</b>

17:49.240 --> 17:50.680
To thank you for today.

17:50.880 --> 17:53.340
<b>100% Wild Animal</b>

17:51.200 --> 17:53.340
You like this drink, don't you?

17:54.370 --> 17:55.160
Yeah.

17:55.160 --> 17:56.830
What? Did I get it wrong?

17:56.830 --> 17:59.430
No, you're right.

17:59.430 --> 18:00.940
I thought so.

18:03.830 --> 18:05.130
<i>Seriously?</i>

18:06.250 --> 18:09.850
<i>That useless dummy actually pays attention.</i>

18:12.400 --> 18:13.550
<i>Yum.</i>

18:13.550 --> 18:14.820
Now...

18:15.570 --> 18:18.140
Shall we go home before it gets too late?

18:24.520 --> 18:25.770
Tsukuyo-san?

18:26.130 --> 18:27.540
<i>This was a misunderstanding.</i>

18:27.950 --> 18:31.540
<i>This was all my misunderstanding.</i>

18:31.870 --> 18:36.760
<i>Akagami's confession 
and today's date. All of it.</i>

18:37.760 --> 18:43.560
<i>I'm definitely misunderstanding my own 
desire to spend more time with him, but...</i>

18:44.590 --> 18:46.850
Hey, Akagami.

18:46.850 --> 18:47.770
Yes?

18:49.750 --> 18:51.110
Um...

18:52.020 --> 18:56.600
